<title>UK: CSFB sets warrants on Fresenius.</title>
<headline>CSFB sets warrants on Fresenius.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston Effecten has issued one million American-style call warrants, on Fresenius Medical Care AG share, lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston said.</p>
<p>One warrant controla one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    170 DEM		   PREMIUM	20.93 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     23.09 DEM		 GEARING	6.82 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	18.SEP.98</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFURT, DUSS	     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  157.50 DEM</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE   CEGS</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
